      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The region enjoys a Mediterranean climate: cool, wet winters and hot, dry summers, with winter rain and occasional snow at the highest peaks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
