      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Outdoor lovers can hunt, camp, collect gems, bike, ride horses, hike, or simply enjoy scenic views in the Clear Creek area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
